topic("Boot problems / repair the bootloader", "wont boot, boot problem, boot repair, grub, grub rescue, bootloader, repair boot, cant boot, reinstall grub, no boot", """
    Boot the Verity live ISO, mount your system, and reinstall the bootloader:
    ```text
    lsblk -f
    mount /dev/sdXn /mnt                    (root partition)
    mount /dev/sdXm /mnt/boot               (EFI partition, UEFI systems only)
    arch-chroot /mnt
    grub-install --target=x86_64-efi --efi-directory=/boot --removable      (UEFI)
    grub-install --target=i386-pc /dev/sdX                                  (BIOS)
    grub-mkconfig -o /boot/grub/grub.cfg
    exit
    ```
    Replace the sdX names with yours from lsblk. Take care to pick the right partitions.
""")

